 "citation": {
  "text": "SPYDER Bone (Narrow 1545 nm); calibration data Ryder, C. et al. 2026. Refining near-infrared spectroscopy for collagen quantification in archaeological bone. Journal of Archaeological Science 185:106448 (calibration spectra and yields: supplement mmc2).",
